Photorealistic luxury app icon, square, straight-on. Full-bleed deep black fine-grain leather background. Centered, filling the central 66 percent: one circular medallion, half studio knob, half vinyl record. Rim: polished champagne gold, diamond-knurled like a high-end mixing console knob, with a mirror-polished gold inner bevel. Face: glossy piano-black vinyl with very fine concentric grooves and two soft sweeping reflections. On the face, two centered lines in bold flowing connected vintage script, raised 3D gold gel-paint letters with glossy highlights: first line "Killa", second line "YuE" (capital Y, lowercase u, capital E). Lettering very large and legible at tiny sizes. A thin ring of warm amber light glows between rim and record, like a valve amplifier. Gold, black, restrained amber. Jewelry-grade product photography, crisp focus. No other objects, no extra text, no watermark, no border.
